      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_iceland",
      "text": "You write a kind of pamphlet about feeling. It is, against all reason, smuggled to the cities. Some Alphas, late at night, read it.",
      "sceneTitle": "Iceland",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Iceland"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_helmholtz",
      "text": "You join Helmholtz in the Falklands. He writes, for the rest of his life, poems no one needed but you. You read them aloud to a cold sea.",
      "sceneTitle": "Helmholtz's Poems",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Helmholtz's Poems"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_quiet",
      "text": "You take over John's lighthouse. You burn the tourist coins. You read, alone, the books he kept. You decide, slowly, what to do next.",
